      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拥有海外GⅠ获胜经验的里见皇冠。\n还有在经典级赢下『有马纪念』的里见光钻――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17cc9350ea1188eab2bc9c3b1a44ad73cc7e098bc17cb6708aeea640f8658dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
